<h3><u>Ghabrayi hai zainab</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Ghabrayi hei zainub </p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x3</font></p><font size=""4"">
<ol><li>Labreez hei gham sey har bibi ka seena </li><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Ik saal guzara hei zindan-e-sitam mein </li><p>Din baqi guzarey gi zainub isi gham mein </p><p>Maqtal mien hei asghar zindan mein sakina </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Aye ahle madina tu khamosh hi rehna </li><p>Zainub sey khudara to ik lafz na kehna </p><p>Jo sansein bachi hai khodey gi hazeena </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Ye soch key roti hei bemar hei sughra </li><p>Har farz key baare mein ab poochy gi dukhya </p><p>Eisa na ho sun key marjaey hazeena </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Har baat batadoungi jab poochengi sughra </li><p>Baloun ki safedi ka batlaoun sabab kya </p><p>Tha is sey to behter zindan mei jeena </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Jab pursa mujhe diengey sab loog vatan key </li><p>Kis tarha chupaoungi ye neel rasan key </p><p>Ahval safer ka kehdein ye kahien na </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Har zakham suna dey ga ahval safar ka </li><p>Phat jaye na dil us ka jab dekhegi sughra </p><p>Peeshani-e-sajaad ur surkh paseena </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Hujroun mein jo jaoungi mein awn-o-muhammad key </li><p>Us dil ko rulayeingey bachoun key khiloney </p><p>Dil shiddat-e-gham sey phat jaye kahien na </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Sab kuch to luta aayi pardees mein zainub </li><p>Mazlooma musafir ye kia jee key karey ab </p><p>Bin bhai key ab to dushvar hei jeena </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Zainub key khayaloun mien aawaz ye aayi</li><p>Mahmil sey uter kar jab fizza ney sada di </p><p>Dil tham lo bibi lo aaya madina </p><p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p><li>Kehta hei jiger thaamey ""farhan"" tarap kar </li></ol>

<p>Roodad karo ""mazhar"" bas khatam yahien par </p>
<p>Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina</p>
<p>(Ghabrayi hei zainub aaya hei madina) x2</p></font></p>
